pbar%202%20from%20countertop%201%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22text%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3B%22%20parent%3D%221%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%22460%22%20y%3D%221020%22%20width%3D%22115%22%20height%3D%2240%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2FmxCell%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CmxCell%20id%3D%22jvhkxwPx5Olv1LotMLFh-22%22%20value%3D%22%26%23xa%3B-%20Go%20to%20garbagecan%201%20and%20move%20soapbar%201%20to%20it%20to%20begin%20fulfilling%20the%20goal%26%23xa%3B-%20After%20placing%20one%20soapbar%2C%20return%20to%20countertop%20to%20retrieve%20the%20second%20soapbar%26%23xa%3B-%20Confirm%20that%20both%20soapbars%20are%20in%20the%20garbagecan%20before%20concluding%20the%20task%22%20style%3D%22text%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3B%22%20parent%3D%221%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%22243%22%20y%3D%221220%22%20width%3D%22177%22%20height%3D%2270%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%20%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2FmxCell%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3CUserObject%20label%3D%22Agent%20Thought%3A%26%23xa%3B%5B...%5D%20**Refresh%20necessary%3F**%26%23xa%3BYes%2C%20because%3A%26%23xa%3B-%20The%20current%20strategy%20assumes%20that%20%26quot%3Btake%26quot%3B%20is%20available%2C%20but%20it%20is%20not.%26%23xa%3B-%20The%20environment%20does%20not%20allow%20taking%20soapbar%202%20because%20the%20action%20is%20not%20in%20the%20admissible%20list.%20%5B...%5D%26%23xa%3B%26lt%3Brefresh_decision%26gt%3Byes%26lt%3B%2Frefresh_decision%26gt%3B%22%20link%3D%22Therefore%2C%20I%20must%20first%20pick%20up%20soapbar%202.%5Cn%5CnBut%20the%20only%20way%20to%20pick%20it%20up%20is%20to%20have%20a%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%5C%26quot%3B%20action.%5Cn%5CnSince%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%5C%26quot%3B%20is%20not%20listed%2C%20and%20only%20%5C%26quot%3Bmove%5C%26quot%3B%20is%20available%2C%20and%20%5C%26quot%3Bmove%5C%26quot%3B%20is%20only%20for%20soapbar%201%2C%20I%20cannot%20take%20soapbar%202.%5Cn%5CnTherefore%2C%20the%20current%20strategy%20is%20flawed%20%5Cu2014%20it%20assumes%20that%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%5C%26quot%3B%20is%20available%2C%20but%20it%20is%20not.%5Cn%5CnThus%2C%20I%20must%20refresh%20the%20strategy.%5Cn%5Cn**Refresh%20necessary%3F**%C2%A0%20%5CnYes%20%5Cu2014%20because%3A%5Cn-%20The%20current%20strategy%20assumes%20that%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%5C%26quot%3B%20is%20available%2C%20but%20it%20is%20not.%5Cn-%20The%20environment%20does%20not%20allow%20taking%20soapbar%202%20because%20the%20action%20is%20not%20in%20the%20admissible%20list.%5Cn-%20This%20is%20a%20critical%20ambiguity%3A%20we%20cannot%20pick%20up%20items%20without%20a%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%5C%26quot%3B%20action.%5Cn%5CnTherefore%2C%20I%20must%20refresh%20the%20strategy%20to%20account%20for%20the%20lack%20of%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%5C%26quot%3B%20action%20and%20instead%20rely%20on%20%5C%26quot%3Bgo%20to%5C%26quot%3B%20and%20%5C%26quot%3Bexamine%5C%26quot%3B%20to%20locate%20items%2C%20and%26%23xa%3B%C2%A0only%20if%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%5C%26quot%3B%20is%20available%2C%20proceed.%5Cn%5CnBut%20in%20this%20case%2C%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%5C%26quot%3B%20is%20not%20available%20for%20soapbar%202.%5Cn%5CnSo%20the%20only%20viable%20action%20is%20to%20go%20to%20countertop%201%20and%20examine%20it%20to%20confirm%20soapbar%202%20is%20still%20there%20%5Cu2014%20which%20it%20is%20%5Cu2014%20and%20then%20try%20to%20take%20it%20again.%5Cn%5CnBut%20I%20can%26%2339%3Bt.%5Cn%5CnAlternatively%2C%20perhaps%20the%20environment%20allows%20only%20one%20soapbar%20to%20be%20picked%20up%20at%20a%20time%2C%20and%20I%20need%20to%20go%20to%20sinkbasin%20to%20find%20another%20soapbar%20%5Cu2014%20but%20there%20is%20no%20mention%20of%20soapbars%20there.%5Cn%5CnSo%20I%20must%20conclude%20that%20the%20action%20%5C%26quot%3Btake%20soapbar%202%5C%26quot%3B%20is%20not%20available%2C%20and%20thus%20the%20strategy%20must%20be%20updated.%5Cn%5CnTherefore%2C%20I%20request%20a%20strategy%20refresh.%5Cn%5Cn%26lt%3Brefresh_decision%26gt%